WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.825
Let’s walk through Your role in the exercise.

00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:07.175
Use this opening step to establish ownership before learning controls

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:07.350
.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.512
Identify what this seat creates or reviews, what must

00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:13.700
be handed to another role, and which decisions remain

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.438
outside your authority.

00:00:15.438 --> 00:00:19.225
On this slide, the Game Master owns session administration

00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:23.163
and the operational evidence boundary around the live exercise.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.997
In practice, prepare the run before participants arrive,

00:00:26.997 --> 00:00:30.360
verify that every seat resolves to the intended role,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.922
and preserve an export another operator can reproduce.

00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:36.722
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:36.722 --> 00:00:39.110
Create and select the correct session.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:42.097
Monitor participants and operator handoff.

00:00:42.097 --> 00:00:45.685
Keep plugins and exports scoped to the selected session.
